{
  "borough": "Waltham Forest",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The principle of development is unacceptable, the proposed HMO would result in the loss of a single-family dwelling, to the detriment of the supply of family housing to meet the Borough&#39;s long-term needs contrary to Policy 20&nbsp;of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan Part 1 (2024).",
    "The proposed development would result in a cramped and unsatisfactory form of living environment for existing and future occupiers failing to meet minimum space standard requirements in relation to the combined kitchen and dining area; all bedrooms being undersized and lack of external amenity space&nbsp;contrary to Policies 20, 53 and 56 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan Part 1 (2024).",
    "The proposed development fails to make adequate provision for secure storage of 5No. bicycles, contrary to Policy 20&nbsp;and Appendix 1 – Parking standards of the adopted Waltham Forest&nbsp;Local Plan Part 1 (2024).",
    "The proposed development fails to make adequate provision for storage of refuse and recycling, contrary to Policy 57&nbsp;of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan Part 1 (2024)."
  ],
